+/// GNX-UG: draws like gnx_draw_sprite_ext (arg0 sprite, arg1 frame, arg2/arg3 x/y, arg4/arg5 scale,
+/// arg6 angle, arg7 colour, arg8 alpha), but only the rows at or below global.gnx_clip_top.
+/// Rotated or upside-down draws (arg6 != 0, arg5 <= 0) are skipped: nothing below the floor uses them.
+function gnx_draw_sprite_clip(arg0, arg1, arg2, arg3, arg4, arg5, arg6, arg7, arg8)
+{
+    // the clipping below works for upright sprites only (angle 0, y scale above 0)
